; The constraints of the scenario Spatial, then a _GROUP constraint, for IntegrationParser
; (Tests/Integration/Parser/FMTModelParser.cpp): each spatial constraint must be written so that it reads back
; the same. No other scenario of TWD_land has a _GROUP constraint.

*OBJECTIVE
_MAXMIN oVolRec 1.._LENGTH

*CONSTRAINTS

Burnedarea = 0 1.._LENGTH
oVolRec <= 48000 1.._LENGTH
_EVEN(oVolRec) 1.._LENGTH

;spatial constraint
_SIZE(coupetotale,4) >= 2 1.._LENGTH
_SIZE(coupetotale,4) <= 2 1.._LENGTH
_ADJACENCY(coupetotale,1) >= 1 1.._LENGTH
_GROUP(coupetotale,_TH1,2) >= 1 1.._LENGTH

*FORMAT MOSEK
